# fmsynth.obligations — disposition for every `allium plan` obligation of fmsynth.allium.
#   <id> => structural | test:<name> exercises=<symbol> | waived: <reason>
# The behavioural obligations get runnable tests under plan/0006 once the driver's own
# OPL3 synth (call/0014) builds from the vendored DDK bundle (call/0008).

# --- Spec-integrity (covered by the check/analyse lane) ---
config-default.voice_count       => structural
config-default.drum_channel      => structural
entity-fields.Note               => structural
entity-fields.Voice              => structural
transition-rejected.Voice.state  => structural
transition-terminal.Voice.state  => structural
surface-actor.FmSynth            => structural
surface-provides.FmSynth         => structural

# --- Behavioural (no runnable tests yet; discharged under plan/0006) ---
transition-edge.Voice.free.sounding    => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
transition-edge.Voice.sounding.free    => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.DrumChannelIsPercussion   => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-failure.DrumChannelIsPercussion.1 => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.NoteOnSounds              => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
rule-success.NoteOffReleases           => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
invariant.VoiceBudget                  => waived: no runnable tests until plan/0006 (needs a build; call/0008)
